#: includes/class-cogs-reports.php:667
msgid "If I change a product cost price today, will it alter past order profits?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-cogs-reports.php:668
msgid "Never! When an order is completed, its financials (cost, gateway fees, courier deficit, net profit) are locked permanently into that order’s metadata. Changing prices today will only apply to future orders."
msgstr ""

